<Base title="About PoolSizeData" description="PoolSizeData gives pool owners free calculators and size charts, with the formula and source shown for every number." crumbs={[['About']]}>
  <h1>About PoolSizeData</h1>
  <p>Pool advice often comes from whoever sells the chemicals. PoolSizeData shows the sums instead, so you can see why a dose is what it is and check it yourself. We mark which targets come from health authorities, which come from makers and which are simply common practice.</p>
  <p>We are independent and not a pool service. For structural, electrical or health questions, please ask a licensed professional. Questions or corrections: <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
</Base>
